Interview Questions

You should be able to answer:

What is Stream API?
Difference between Collection and Stream?
Difference between map() and filter()?
Difference between forEach() and map()?
What are intermediate operations?
What are terminal operations?
Are Streams reusable?
Can Streams modify the original collection?

Difference between map and flatMap?
map: (1-to-1 transformation): Converts each element into one other element.
If you map a list of lists, you get a stream of lists.

flatMap: (1-to-many flattening): Converts each element into a stream of elements,
and then merges all those individual streams into a single consolidated stream


